      "season": 4,
      "episode": 8,
      "number": 8,
      "released": "2009-10-22T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Katherine freaks out when Katlego brings a surprise visitor home. Thandeka is thwarted in her attempts to open a case against Gloria but refuses to give up. Grace has to leave and find her own place in the world. She is perhaps too honest for her own good.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt0989255/4/8/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 5470606
    },
