      "episode": 9,
      "number": 9,
      "released": "2009-10-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Bitchy Mpume knows exactly how to get to Vuyo. Thandeka is scared about how far Gloria will go. Lesley and Nandi are paranoid about Grace's jailbird past. Katlego and Thandeka open up to one another. Grace gets to the truth about her sister's issues with her.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt0989255/4/9/w780.jpg",
